<title>BRAZIL: Bahia cocoa arrivals reach 2.58 mln bags by Jan 5.</title>
<headline>Bahia cocoa arrivals reach 2.58 mln bags by Jan 5.</headline>
<dateline>SALVADOR, Brazil 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bahia 1996/97 cocoa arrivals totalled 2,579,089 million 60-kg bags by the week ending January 5 compared with 2,209,217 bags by January 7 last year, the Brazilian Trade Commission Comcauba said.</p>
<p>Arrivals in the three weeks from December 16 to January 5</p>
<p>were as follows in 60-kg bags.</p>
<p> WEEK		  1996/97	     1995/96	    1994/95</p>
<p> Dec 16-22	    63,361		99,233	    141,019</p>
<p> Dec 23-29	    65,078		68,203	    139,366</p>
<p> Dec 30-Jan 5	 54,884	     167,988	    127,613</p>
<p>-- Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
</text>
